  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"G\xFCne\u015F\" kart\u0131n\u0131 se\xE7tin.\n\nHarika
    bir kartla kar\u015F\u0131 kar\u015F\u0131yay\u0131z. Ayd\u0131nl\u0131k yar\u0131nlar\u0131n\u0131n
    temelini sen ge\xE7mi\u015Fte \xE7oktan atm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n {{isim}}. Seni
    karanl\u0131\u011Fa s\xFCr\xFCkleyebilecek t\xFCm k\xF6t\xFCc\xFCl ihtimalleri
    ortadan kald\u0131rm\u0131\u015F, sana ba\u015Far\u0131, sa\u011Fl\u0131k, huzur
    ve mutluluk getirecek en do\u011Fru yola daha en ba\u015F\u0131ndan girmi\u015Fsin.
    Pozitif d\xFC\u015F\xFCnmeyi ve \u015F\xFCkretmeyi asla ihmal etmemi\u015F, insanlar
    taraf\u0131ndan da bu y\xF6nlerinle hep takdir g\xF6rm\xFC\u015Fs\xFCn. S\u0131cak,
    i\xE7ten ve samimi y\xF6nlerinle \xE7evrene de her zaman ne\u015Fe sa\xE7t\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    g\xF6r\xFCyorum. Hayallerinin ger\xE7ekle\u015Fece\u011Fi g\xFCnlere bu denli
    yak\u0131n olmay\u0131 sen \xE7oktan hak etmi\u015Fsin."
